{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455","id":2410151977,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PqAAp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104455","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104455/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/09e7bef0e002a533f46a40238e6ac9d27dc62912","number":104455,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize startup times by using `ubrk_clone` instead of `ubrk_open`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This decreases editor startup time by ~0.35s (8%).\r\n\r\nIt should be possible to safely cherry-pick this back to 4.4.\r\n\r\n## Explanation \r\n\r\nI have previously profiled that `ubrk_open` was causing substantial delays in editor startup times (#102129).\r\nI've dug a bit deeper into the code, and found that cloning `UBreakIterator` instances instead of creating them from scratch doesn't parse the locale (rules?) again (which was the slow part). So, in the interest of speed, I've implemented a method to cache a blueprint `UBreakIterator` for each locale, and only clone it when we need a new one. \r\n\r\nThis is not only faster than #102129, but also better in terms of RAM use — because not every `FontAdvanced` instance needs their own `UBreakIterator` caches. Instead, we only have one for each locale globally.\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\nI benchmarked a ~0.35s (8%) decrease in editor startup time:\r\n\r\n```\r\n ❯ hyperfine -m25 -iw1 \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\" \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      4.781 s ±  0.120 s    [User: 3.266 s, System: 0.406 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    4.469 s …  4.974 s    25 runs\r\n\r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      4.435 s ±  0.095 s    [User: 3.011 s, System: 0.387 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    4.250 s …  4.557 s    25 runs\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit ran\r\n    1.08 ± 0.04 times faster than bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n```\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":